<h1 class="doc-h1">Aspect Ratio</h1>
<p class="doc-lede">
    A box that keeps its shape while its width changes. One CSS property does it, so this is a
    wrapper and nothing more — and giving the image inside it real <code>width</code> and
    <code>height</code> attributes is what stops the page reflowing as it loads.
</p>

